	(text "--Change log from rev 0.3--\nRemoved light bank relay A (F2, K2, D5, IC2, R7, D11, R32)\nRemoved light bank relay B (F3, K3, D6, IC3, R8, D12, R33)\nRemoved connector J2, J8, J9\nChanged J10 to a 2 pin Molex Micro-Fit\nChanged J3 to a 4 pin Molex Micro-Fit\nChanged J13 to a 4 pin Molex Micro-Fit\nRemove External relay circuit (IC6)\nAdded external status light 3 colors circuit\nChanged U4 from R1560S501B-E2-FE to MCP1793T-5002H/OT because no stock\nAdded gate driver circuit to replace sticking relay\nChanged LT1910ES8 to MCP1416R because of no stock"
